# The Tale of Tamiyo through all four chapters. Chapters I, II and III each mill two cards that share no type (Lightning Bolt and a planeswalker; a creature
# and an Island; Mox Jet and Lightning Bolt), so nothing is drawn. Chapter IV (CR 714.2b), on turn 7: Bot1 targets a Lightning Bolt and Tamiyo, Collector of Tales (a
# Tamiyo planeswalker card) in the graveyard, leaving the other Bolt, Tamiyo, Inquisitive Student (a creature, not a planeswalker, in the graveyard) and the rest
# (any number of targets, 115.1d). Both are exiled and copied; Bot1 casts both copies with its mana (Mox Ruby's {R} for the Bolt, which hits Bot2 for 3, and four
# Islands for the Scholar, which enters), and the Saga is sacrificed once its last chapter has resolved (CR 714.4).

